OL,3,GNEWSA'Even my pick and mix shop is
OL,4,Agetting robbed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a pick and mix shop in
OL,7,FEast Sussex has said she moved premises
OL,8,Fbecause staff felt "very unsafe" due to
OL,9,Fongoing thefts.
OL,11,FAlison Nicholls, who owns the Rainbows
OL,12,FSweet Shop in Hastings, said "even
OL,13,Fkids" were stealing after seeing videos
OL,14,Fof people 'taking whatever they want"
OL,15,Ffrom shops.
OL,17,FShe added that people would still come
OL,18,Fto the new location for a "bit of
OL,19,Ffive-finger discount", though staff
OL,20,Fwere much happier there.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
